%N A402440 a(n) = A402439(A102476(n)); largest k in [1,N] coprime to N such that k is a quadratic residue modulo N, N = A102476(n).
%C A402440 N = A102476(n) is the least number such that the multiplicative group of integers modulo N has 2^n square roots of 1.
%C A402440 a(n) is the largest element in row A102476(n) of A096103.
